# SFace is 37MB and arrives on first run, verified against a hash published by
# the model's own repository. Thirty-seven megabytes in git is a cost every
# clone pays forever; YuNet at 227KB is committed instead.
models/face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx
models/*.tmp-*

# The face fixture the detection and discrimination tests use. A photograph of
# a person in git history is permanent and effectively unremovable, and this
# feature's whole brief is about not holding biometric data for people who did
# not ask to be held. Create one locally with scripts/capture-fixture.mjs; the
# tests that need it skip loudly when it is absent.
test/fixtures/face.jpg
test/fixtures/*.png
test/fixtures/*.raw
